{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13168","headline":"送钱唐路少府赴制举 · 皇甫冉","name":"送钱唐路少府赴制举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公车待诏赴长安，客里新正阻旧欢。\n迟日未能销野雪，晴花偏自犯江寒。\n东溟道路通秦塞，北阙威仪识汉官。\n共许郄诜工射策，恩荣请向一枝看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}